      - title: Guid
        value: 2e09c320-dab2-4266-a1db-ad7c92ed2be2
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: 'Oh, Misaki. Was ist mit Blumen?

          Vergessen Sie nicht, es
          der Schreinjungfrau zu geben.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u0913\u0939, \u092E\u093F\u0938\u093E\u0915\u0940\u0964 \u092B\u0942\u0932\u094B\u0902
          \u0915\u0947 \u092C\u093E\u0930\u0947 \u092E\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u094D\u092F\u093E?\n\u0907\u0938\u0947
          \u0924\u0940\u0930\u094D\u0925\u092F\u093E\u0924\u094D\u0930\u0940 \u0915\u094B
          \u0926\u0947\u0928\u093E \u0928 \u092D\u0942\u0932\u0947\u0902\u0964"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: 'Oh, Misaki. Bagaimana dengan bunga?

          Jangan lupa untuk
          memberikannya pada gadis kuil.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: 'Oh, Misaki. E i fiori?

          Non dimenticare di darlo alla fanciulla
          del santuario.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: "Ah, Misaki. E as flores?\nN\xE3o esque\xE7a de entreg\xE1-las \xE0
          sacerdotisa do santu\xE1rio."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uC544\uB77C, \uBBF8\uC0AC\uD0A4. \uAF43\uC740? \uBB34\uB140\uB2D8\uAED8
          \uC804\uD558\uB294 \uAC78 \uC78A\uC9C0 \uB9C8\uC138\uC694"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u041E, \u041C\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043A\u0438. \u0410 \u043A\u0430\u043A
          \u043D\u0430\u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u0446\u0432\u0435\u0442\u043E\u0432?\n\u041D\u0435
          \u0437\u0430\u0431\u0443\u0434\u044C\u0442\u0435 \u043E\u0442\u0434\u0430\u0442\u044C
          \u0435\u0433\u043E \u0436\u0440\u0438\u0446\u0435."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: "Ah, Misaki. \xBFQu\xE9 pasa con las flores?\nNo olvides d\xE1rselo
          a la doncella del santuario."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Voi Misaki. Ent\xE4 kukat?\n\xC4l\xE4 unohda antaa sit\xE4 pyh\xE4k\xF6lle."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: "Oh, Misaki. Et les fleurs ?\nN'oubliez pas de le donner \xE0 la jeune
          fille du sanctuaire."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u3042\u3089\u3001\u7F8E\u54B2\u3002\u82B1\u306F\uFF1F\n\u5DEB\u5973\u69D8\u306B\u6E21\u3059\u306E\u3092\u5FD8\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3067"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u5662\uFF0C\u7F8E\u54B2\u3002\u9C9C\u82B1\u5462\uFF1F\n\u522B\u5FD8\u4E86\u4EA4\u7ED9\u5DEB\u5973\u54E6\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u5662\uFF0C\u7F8E\u54B2\u3002\u9C9C\u82B1\u5462\uFF1F\n\u522B\u5FD8\u4E86\u4EA4\u7ED9\u5DEB\u5973\u54E6\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: Oh, Misaki. The flowers? Don't forget to give them to the shrine maiden.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
