      - title: de
        value: 'Ja, das stimmt

          Gehen Sie vorsichtig'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u0939\u093E\u0901, \u092F\u0939 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\n\u0927\u094D\u092F\u093E\u0928
          \u0938\u0947 \u091C\u093E\u0913"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: 'Ya itu benar

          pergi dengan hati-hati'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "S\xEC, \xE8 vero\nvai con attenzione"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: "Sim, \xE9 isso.\nV\xE1 com cuidado."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uC751, \uADF8\uB798\uC694. \uC870\uC2EC\uD574\uC11C \uB2E4\uB140\uC624\uC138\uC694"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u0414\u0430, \u044D\u0442\u043E \u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0434\u0430\n\u0438\u0434\u0438
          \u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: 'Si, eso es correcto

          ve con cuidado'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Kyll\xE4, se on oikein\nmene varovasti"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: 'Ouais, c''est vrai

          allez prudemment'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u3048\u3048\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3088\n\u6C17\u3092\u3064\u3051\u3066\u884C\u304D\u306A\u3055\u3044"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u662F\u7684\uFF0C\u6CA1\u9519\n\u5C0F\u5FC3\u70B9"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u662F\u7684\uFF0C\u6CA1\u9519\n\u5C0F\u5FC3\u70B9"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: Yes, that's right. Take care.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
