        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: "\xC4hm ... ist die Schreinjungfrau nicht hier?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u0909\u092E\u094D\u092E...\u0915\u094D\u092F\u093E \u0924\u0940\u0930\u094D\u0925
          \u092F\u0941\u0935\u0924\u0940 \u092F\u0939\u093E\u0901 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902
          \u0939\u0948?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: Um...bukankah gadis kuil ada di sini?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Uhm... la fanciulla del santuario non \xE8 qui?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: "Ah\u2026 a sacerdotisa n\xE3o est\xE1 aqui?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uC800... \uBB34\uB140\uB2D8\uC740 \uACC4\uC2ED\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u042D\u043C... \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0432\u0435 \u0437\u0434\u0435\u0441\u044C
          \u043D\u0435 \u0436\u0440\u0438\u0446\u0430?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: "Um... \xBFno est\xE1 aqu\xED la doncella del santuario?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "\xD6h...eik\xF6 pyh\xE4kk\xF6neito ole t\xE4\xE4ll\xE4?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: Euh... la jeune fille du sanctuaire n'est-elle pas ici ?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u3042\u306E...\u5DEB\u5973\u69D8\u306F\u3044\u3089\u3063\u3057\u3083\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\uFF1F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u5443\u2026\u2026\u5DEB\u5973\u4E0D\u5728\u5417\uFF1F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u5443\u2026\u2026\u5DEB\u5973\u4E0D\u5728\u5417\uFF1F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: Um... is the shrine maiden here?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
