        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u307E\u3060\u304A\u898B\u304B\u3051\u3057\u3066\u306A\u3044\u308F\u306D\u3047\n\u73CD\u3057\u3044\u308F\u3002\u3044\u3064\u3082\u306A\u3089\u3053\u306E\u6642\u9593\u3001\u672C\u5802\u3067\u5F85\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306E\u306B\n"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Video File
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: canvasRect
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: EventGuid
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Guid
        value: 9398ec2b-1448-44f0-9bee-a87c6910b6a7
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: "Ich habe dich heute noch nicht gesehen.\nEs ist selten. Normalerweise
          w\xFCrde ich um diese Zeit in der Haupthalle warten."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u092E\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0924\u0941\u092E\u094D\u0939\u0947\u0902
          \u0906\u091C \u0924\u0915 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u093E\u0964\n\u092F\u0939
          \u0905\u0928\u0942\u0920\u093E \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0938\u093E\u092E\u093E\u0928\u094D\u092F\u0924\u0903
          \u0907\u0938 \u0938\u092E\u092F \u092E\u0948\u0902 \u092E\u0941\u0916\u094D\u092F
          \u0939\u0949\u0932 \u092E\u0947\u0902 \u092A\u094D\u0930\u0924\u0940\u0915\u094D\u0937\u093E
          \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093E \u0939\u094B\u0924\u093E\u0964"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: 'Aku belum melihatmu hari ini.

          Ini jarang terjadi. Biasanya
          saya akan menunggu di aula utama saat ini.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Non ti ho ancora visto oggi.\n\xC8 raro. Normalmente a quest'ora
          avrei aspettato nella sala principale."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: "Ainda n\xE3o a vi hoje. \xC9 estranho \u2014 normalmente ela estaria
          esperando no sal\xE3o principal a esta hora."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uC624\uB298\uC740 \uC544\uC9C1 \uBABB \uBD59\uACA0\uB124.\n\uD3C9\uC18C\uB77C\uBA74
          \uC774 \uC2DC\uAC04\uCBE4 \uBCF8\uB2F9\uC5D0\uC11C \uBCFC \uC218 \uC788\uC744
          \uD150\uB370."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u042F \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u043D\u0435 \u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043B
          \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F \u0441\u0435\u0433\u043E\u0434\u043D\u044F.\n\u042D\u0442\u043E
          \u0440\u0435\u0434\u043A\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044C. \u041E\u0431\u044B\u0447\u043D\u043E
          \u044F \u0436\u0434\u0430\u043B \u0431\u044B \u0432 \u044D\u0442\u043E
          \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u044F \u0432 \u0433\u043B\u0430\u0432\u043D\u043E\u043C
          \u0437\u0430\u043B\u0435."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: "Todav\xEDa no te he visto hoy.\nEs raro. Normalmente estar\xEDa esperando
          en el sal\xF3n principal a esta hora."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "En ole n\xE4hnyt sinua viel\xE4 t\xE4n\xE4\xE4n.\nSe on harvinaista.
          Normaalisti odotan t\xE4h\xE4n aikaan p\xE4\xE4salissa."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: "Je ne t'ai pas encore vu aujourd'hui.\nC'est rare. Normalement, j'attendrais
          dans le hall principal \xE0 ce moment-l\xE0."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u307E\u3060\u304A\u898B\u304B\u3051\u3057\u3066\u306A\u3044\u308F\u306D\u3047\n\u73CD\u3057\u3044\u308F\u3002\u3044\u3064\u3082\u306A\u3089\u3053\u306E\u6642\u9593\u3001\u672C\u5802\u3067\u5F85\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306E\u306B\n"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u6211\u4ECA\u5929\u8FD8\u6CA1\u89C1\u5230\u4F60\u3002\n\u8FD9\u662F\u5F88\u5C11\u89C1\u7684\u3002\u5E73\u65F6\u8FD9\u4E2A\u65F6\u5019\u6211\u90FD\u4F1A\u5728\u5927\u6BBF\u7B49\u5019\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u6211\u4ECA\u5929\u8FD8\u6CA1\u89C1\u5230\u4F60\u3002\n\u8FD9\u662F\u5F88\u5C11\u89C1\u7684\u3002\u5E73\u65F6\u8FD9\u4E2A\u65F6\u5019\u6211\u90FD\u4F1A\u5728\u5927\u6BBF\u7B49\u5019\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: "I haven't seen her today. That's unusual\u2014she's usually waiting
          in the main hall at this hour."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
