      - title: Guid
        value: ece471c7-0fc3-4751-bf89-11d25373f6a9
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: 'Diese Blume hat eine sehr seltene Farbe.

          Wo hast du es
          ausgesucht?'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u0909\u0938 \u092B\u0942\u0932 \u0915\u093E \u0930\u0902\u0917 \u0905\u0924\u094D\u092F\u0902\u0924
          \u0926\u0941\u0930\u094D\u0932\u092D \u0939\u0948\u0964\n\u0906\u092A\u0928\u0947
          \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0939\u093E\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u091A\u0941\u0928\u093E?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: 'Bunga itu memiliki warna yang sangat langka.

          Dimana kamu
          mengambilnya?'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: 'Quel fiore ha un colore molto raro.

          Dove l''hai raccolto?'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: "Essa flor tem uma cor bem diferente. Onde voc\xEA a colheu?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uADF8 \uAF43 \uC0C9\uAE54 \uC815\uB9D0 \uD76C\uADC0\uD558\uB124.
          \uC5B4\uB514\uC11C \uAEBE\uC740 \uAC70\uC57C?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u042D\u0442\u043E\u0442 \u0446\u0432\u0435\u0442\u043E\u043A \u0438\u043C\u0435\u0435\u0442
          \u043E\u0447\u0435\u043D\u044C \u0440\u0435\u0434\u043A\u0438\u0439 \u0446\u0432\u0435\u0442.\n\u0413\u0434\u0435
          \u0442\u044B \u0435\u0433\u043E \u0432\u0437\u044F\u043B?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: "Esa flor tiene un color muy raro.\n\xBFD\xF3nde lo elegiste?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "T\xE4ll\xE4 kukalla on hyvin harvinainen v\xE4ri.\nMist\xE4 valitsit
          sen?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: "Cette fleur a une couleur tr\xE8s rare.\nO\xF9 l'as-tu choisi ?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u305D\u306E\u82B1\u3001\u3068\u3066\u3082\u73CD\u3057\u3044\u8272\u306D\n\u3069\u3053\u3067\u6458\u3093\u3060\u306E\uFF1F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u90A3\u6735\u82B1\u7684\u989C\u8272\u975E\u5E38\u7F55\u89C1\u3002\n\u4F60\u5728\u54EA\u91CC\u6311\u7684\uFF1F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u90A3\u6735\u82B1\u7684\u989C\u8272\u975E\u5E38\u7F55\u89C1\u3002\n\u4F60\u5728\u54EA\u91CC\u6311\u7684\uFF1F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: That flower has a very rare color. Where did you pick it?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
