      - title: EventGuid
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Guid
        value: 89e00963-e24b-4b60-844a-21ad9d22d869
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: 'Nein, es ist nichts.

          Lasst uns schnell ein Opfer darbringen.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u092F\u0939 \u0915\u0941\u091B \u092D\u0940
          \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964\n\u091A\u0932\u094B, \u091C\u0932\u094D\u0926\u0940
          \u0938\u0947 \u091C\u093E\u0915\u0930 \u092D\u0947\u0902\u091F \u091A\u0922\u093C\u093E\u0913\u0964"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: 'Tidak, tidak apa-apa.

          Ayo pergi dan berikan persembahan
          secepatnya.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "No, non \xE8 niente.\nAndiamo a fare un'offerta velocemente."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: "N\xE3o, n\xE3o \xE9 nada. Vamos logo oferecer (as flores)."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uC544\uB2C8\uC57C, \uC544\uBB34\uAC83\uB3C4 \uC544\uB2C8\uC57C.\n\uC790,
          \uC5BC\uB978 \uAF43\uC744 \uBC14\uCE58\uB7EC \uAC00\uC790."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u041D\u0435\u0442, \u044D\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043E.\n\u0414\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435
          \u043F\u043E\u0439\u0434\u0435\u043C \u0438 \u0431\u044B\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E
          \u0441\u0434\u0435\u043B\u0430\u0435\u043C \u043F\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0448\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: "No, no es nada.\nVayamos y hagamos una ofrenda r\xE1pidamente."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Ei, se ei ole mit\xE4\xE4n.\nMenn\xE4\xE4n ja tarjotaan nopeasti."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: 'Non, ce n''est rien.

          Allons faire une offrande rapidement.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3082\u306A\u3044\u306E\n\u3055\u3001\u65E9\u304F\u304A\u4F9B\u3048\u306B\u884C\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u4E0D\uFF0C\u6CA1\u4EC0\u4E48\u3002\n\u6211\u4EEC\u5FEB\u53BB\u4F9B\u517B\u5427\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u4E0D\uFF0C\u6CA1\u4EC0\u4E48\u3002\n\u6211\u4EEC\u5FEB\u53BB\u4F9B\u517B\u5427\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: No, it's nothing. Come on, let's make the offering.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
