        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: canvasRect
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: EventGuid
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Guid
        value: 57c2b8f0-23b0-4331-93b2-d209be943cc9
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: Aber mir wurde gesagt, ich solle es der Schreinjungfrau geben ...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u0932\u0947\u0915\u093F\u0928 \u092E\u0941\u091D\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0939\u093E
          \u0917\u092F\u093E \u0915\u093F \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092E\u0902\u0926\u093F\u0930
          \u0915\u0940 \u092F\u0941\u0935\u0924\u0940 \u0915\u094B \u0926\u0947 \u0926\u094B..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: Tapi aku disuruh memberikannya pada gadis kuil...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Ma mi \xE8 stato detto di darlo alla fanciulla del santuario..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: "Mas a sacerdotisa me disse para entreg\xE1-lo a ela..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uD558\uC9C0\uB9CC \uBB34\uB140\uC5D0\uAC8C \uAC74\uB124\uC8FC\uB77C\uACE0
          \uB9D0\uD574\uC838..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u041D\u043E \u043C\u043D\u0435 \u0441\u043A\u0430\u0437\u0430\u043B\u0438
          \u043E\u0442\u0434\u0430\u0442\u044C \u0435\u0433\u043E \u0436\u0440\u0438\u0446\u0435..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Pero me dijeron que se lo diera a la doncella del santuario...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Mutta minun k\xE4skettiin antaa se pyh\xE4k\xF6lle..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: "Mais on m'a dit de le donner \xE0 la jeune fille du sanctuaire..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u5DEB\u5973\u69D8\u306B\u6E21\u3059\u3088\u3046\u306B\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u3066\u3066..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u4F46\u6211\u88AB\u544A\u77E5\u8981\u628A\u5B83\u4EA4\u7ED9\u5DEB\u5973\u2026\u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u4F46\u6211\u88AB\u544A\u77E5\u8981\u628A\u5B83\u4EA4\u7ED9\u5DEB\u5973\u2026\u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: But I was told to give it to the shrine maiden...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
