      - title: Guid
        value: 698ab48d-7008-4f2c-a6a4-7cde10d06dbb
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: "Ja\u2026\nWarum kommen Sie in diesem Fall nicht sp\xE4ter wieder?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u0939\u093E\u0901\u2026\n\u0909\u0938 \u0938\u094D\u0925\u093F\u0924\u093F
          \u092E\u0947\u0902, \u0906\u092A \u092C\u093E\u0926 \u092E\u0947\u0902
          \u0935\u093E\u092A\u0938 \u0915\u094D\u092F\u094B\u0902 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902
          \u0906\u0924\u0947?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: "Ya\u2026\nKalau begitu, kenapa kamu tidak kembali lagi nanti?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "S\xCC\u2026\nIn tal caso, perch\xE9 non torni pi\xF9 tardi?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: "Hum\u2026 ent\xE3o, por que n\xE3o volta mais tarde?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uC74C\u2026\n\uADF8\uB7FC \uB098\uC911\uC5D0 \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC624\uBA74
          \uB418\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC744\uAE4C?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u0434\u0430\u2026\n\u0412 \u0442\u0430\u043A\u043E\u043C \u0441\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0435,
          \u043F\u043E\u0447\u0435\u043C\u0443 \u0431\u044B \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435
          \u043D\u0435 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F \u043F\u043E\u0437\u0436\u0435?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: "S\xED\u2026\nEn ese caso, \xBFpor qu\xE9 no vuelves m\xE1s tarde?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "kyll\xE4\u2026\nMikset siin\xE4 tapauksessa palaisi my\xF6hemmin?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: "Oui\u2026\nDans ce cas, pourquoi ne reviens-tu pas plus tard ?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u305D\u3046\u2026\n\u306A\u3089\u3001\u307E\u305F\u5F8C\u3067\u6765\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\uFF1F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u662F\u7684\u2026\n\u65E2\u7136\u5982\u6B64\uFF0C\u4F60\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u4E0D\u665A\u70B9\u56DE\u6765\u5462\uFF1F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u662F\u7684\u2026\n\u65E2\u7136\u5982\u6B64\uFF0C\u4F60\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u4E0D\u665A\u70B9\u56DE\u6765\u5462\uFF1F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: I see... In that case, why not come back later?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
