        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: "Ich stimme zu\u2026\nIch gehe einmal nach Hause"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u092E\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u0939\u092E\u0924 \u0939\u0942\u0902\u2026\n\u092E\u0948\u0902
          \u090F\u0915 \u092C\u093E\u0930 \u0918\u0930 \u091C\u093E\u090A\u0901\u0917\u093E"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: "Saya setuju\u2026\nAku akan pulang suatu saat nanti"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Sono d'accordo\u2026\nAndr\xF2 a casa una volta"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: Isso mesmo... Vou para casa por enquanto.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uADF8\uB807\uB124\uC694\u2026 \uC7A0\uC2DC \uC9D1\uC5D0 \uB2E4\uB140\uC624\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u042F \u0441\u043E\u0433\u043B\u0430\u0441\u0435\u043D\u2026\n\u044F
          \u043F\u043E\u0439\u0434\u0443 \u0434\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0439 \u043E\u0434\u0438\u043D
          \u0440\u0430\u0437"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: "Estoy de acuerdo\u2026\nir\xE9 a casa una vez"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Olen samaa mielt\xE4\u2026\nMenen kotiin kerran"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: "Je suis d'accord\u2026\nje rentrerai \xE0 la maison une fois"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u306D\u2026\n\u4E00\u65E6\u5BB6\u306B\u5E30\u308A\u307E\u3059"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u6211\u540C\u610F\u2026\u2026\n\u6211\u4F1A\u56DE\u5BB6\u4E00\u6B21"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u6211\u540C\u610F\u2026\u2026\n\u6211\u4F1A\u56DE\u5BB6\u4E00\u6B21"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: You're right... I'll go home for now.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
