      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "\u305D\u306E\u82B1...\n\u3042\u3093\u307E\u308A\u4EBA\u306B\u306F\u898B\u305B\u306A\u3044\u65B9\u304C\u3044\u3044\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u308F"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Video File
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: canvasRect
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: EventGuid
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Guid
        value: a36f7d47-f0d3-4eb9-aebc-fef65a4cc1b7
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: 'Diese Blume...

          Vielleicht ist es besser, es nicht zu vielen
          Leuten zu zeigen.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u0935\u094B \u092B\u0942\u0932...\n\u0936\u093E\u092F\u0926 \u0907\u0938\u0947
          \u092C\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0905\u0927\u093F\u0915 \u0932\u094B\u0917\u094B\u0902
          \u0915\u094B \u0928 \u0926\u093F\u0916\u093E\u0928\u093E \u0939\u0940 \u092C\u0947\u0939\u0924\u0930
          \u0939\u094B\u0917\u093E\u0964"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: 'Bunga itu...

          Mungkin lebih baik tidak memperlihatkannya
          kepada terlalu banyak orang.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Quel fiore...\nForse \xE8 meglio non mostrarlo a troppe persone."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: "Essas flores...\nTalvez seja melhor n\xE3o mostr\xE1-las para muitas
          pessoas."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uADF8 \uAF43\u2026 \uC544\uBB34\uC5D0\uAC8C\uB098 \uBCF4\uC774\uC9C0
          \uC54A\uB294 \uAC8C \uC88B\uC744\uC9C0\uB3C4 \uBAB0\uB77C."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u042D\u0442\u043E\u0442 \u0446\u0432\u0435\u0442\u043E\u043A...\n\u0412\u043E\u0437\u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E,
          \u043B\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435 \u043D\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0437\u044B\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C
          \u044D\u0442\u043E \u0441\u043B\u0438\u0448\u043A\u043E\u043C \u0431\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0448\u043E\u043C\u0443
          \u043A\u043E\u043B\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0443 \u043B\u044E\u0434\u0435\u0439."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: "Esa flor...\nQuiz\xE1s sea mejor no mostr\xE1rselo a demasiada gente."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Se kukka...\nEhk\xE4 on parempi olla n\xE4ytt\xE4m\xE4tt\xE4 sit\xE4
          liian monelle."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: "Cette fleur...\nIl vaut peut-\xEAtre mieux ne pas le montrer \xE0
          trop de monde."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u305D\u306E\u82B1...\n\u3042\u3093\u307E\u308A\u4EBA\u306B\u306F\u898B\u305B\u306A\u3044\u65B9\u304C\u3044\u3044\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u308F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u90A3\u6735\u82B1...\n\u4E5F\u8BB8\u6700\u597D\u4E0D\u8981\u5411\u592A\u591A\u4EBA\u5C55\u793A\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u90A3\u6735\u82B1...\n\u4E5F\u8BB8\u6700\u597D\u4E0D\u8981\u5411\u592A\u591A\u4EBA\u5C55\u793A\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: That flower... it might be better not to show it to too many people.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
