      - title: Guid
        value: 8e6d8a40-e3ce-4966-b4ac-4f7a8ced548b
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: de
        value: Dann sei vorsichtig, wenn du nach Hause gehst.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: hi
        value: "\u0916\u0948\u0930, \u091C\u092C \u0906\u092A \u0918\u0930 \u091C\u093E\u090F\u0902
          \u0924\u094B \u0938\u093E\u0935\u0927\u093E\u0928 \u0930\u0939\u0947\u0902\u0964"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: id
        value: Kalau begitu, berhati-hatilah saat pulang.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Allora fai attenzione quando torni a casa.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt
        value: Pois bem, tenha cuidado no caminho para casa.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uC870\uC2EC\uD574\uC11C \uB3CC\uC544\uAC00\uB834."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: "\u041D\u0443 \u0442\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u044C
          \u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0436\u0435\u043D, \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430
          \u043F\u043E\u0439\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044C \u0434\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0439."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Pues bien, ten cuidado cuando vuelvas a casa.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: No, ole sitten varovainen, kun menet kotiin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: Eh bien, soyez prudent lorsque vous rentrez chez vous.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3001\u6C17\u3092\u3064\u3051\u3066\u5E30\u3063\u3066\u306D"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-Hans
        value: "\u90A3\u4E48\uFF0C\u56DE\u5BB6\u7684\u65F6\u5019\u4E00\u5B9A\u8981\u5C0F\u5FC3\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: "\u90A3\u4E48\uFF0C\u56DE\u5BB6\u7684\u65F6\u5019\u4E00\u5B9A\u8981\u5C0F\u5FC3\u3002"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: en
        value: Well then, take care on your way home.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
